• Confirm quarterly commitments with support from technology leadership when needed. • Recommend improvements to internal practices and documentation across teams. &nbsp; 

• Communicate clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders, including global Epic product and&nbsp; engineering counterparts. &nbsp; 

Required Skills & Qualifications&nbsp; 

